    <bpmn:process id="W_W3945" name="W3945. AI/ML Development Lifecycle &amp; Responsible-by-Design Controls" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New AI use-case (links to W3931); development cycle
Frequency: Per model + lifecycle
Volume: AI development lifecycle across all models
Owner: AI Governance / Data Science
Participants: AI Governance, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Model Risk (links to VS-21), Privacy (links to VS-91), Security (links to VS-27.3), business AI owners, IT (links to VS-27)
Source: workflow W3945 — AI/ML Development Lifecycle &amp; Responsible-by-Design Controls</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3945_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3945_Lane1" name="AI Governance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3945_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3945_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3945_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3945_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3945_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3945_Start3" name="New AI use-case (links to W3931); development cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3945_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3945_Task4" name="AI Governance/Data-Science embed responsible-by-design controls into the AI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Data-Science embed responsible-by-design controls into the AI development lifecycle (use-case intake → data prep → build → validate → deploy → monitor → retire): governance gates at each stage, documentation requirements, and the model card (links to W3931/W3938) built incrementally
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Data Science / Model Risk
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3945_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3945_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3945_Task5" name="AI Governance/Privacy/Security apply controls at intake: lawful basis/DPIA for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/Privacy/Security apply controls at intake: lawful basis/DPIA for personal data (links to W3939), security review (links to W3950), tiering (links to W3931), and the build-vs-buy/vendor decision (links to W3934)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Privacy / Security
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per use-case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3945_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3945_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3945_Task6" name="AI Governance/Data-Science use approved tools/environment (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AI Governance/Data-Science use approved tools/environment (links to VS-30.2/W3935), maintain data/model lineage and reproducibility, and hand off to validation (links to W3932) and pre-deployment assurance (links to W3946)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Data Science / IT
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3945_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3945_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3945_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3945_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3945_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-616 (ensure controlled execution — AI Lifecycle Operations, Assurance &amp; Value Realization (PA-128.3).) | - operational: lifecycle controls; operational: lineage/versioning
Owner: AI Governance / Data Science</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3945_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3945_Annotation8" targetRef="W3945_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
