    <bpmn:process id="W_W3946" name="W3946. AI Testing, Evaluation &amp; Pre-Deployment Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Model ready for deployment (links to W3945)
Frequency: Per model + revalidation
Volume: Pre-deployment testing for all models
Owner: AI Governance / Model Risk
Participants: AI Governance, Model Risk (links to VS-21), Data Science (links to VS-30.2), business AI owners, Security (links to VS-27.3), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3946 — AI Testing, Evaluation &amp; Pre-Deployment Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3946_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3946_Lane1" name="AI Governance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3946_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3946_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3946_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3946_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3946_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3946_Start3" name="Model ready for deployment (links to W3945)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3946_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3946_Task4" name="AI Governance/Model-Risk run pre-deployment testing: accuracy/performance vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Model-Risk run pre-deployment testing: accuracy/performance vs threshold, fairness/bias (links to W3937), explainability (links to W3938), robustness/adversarial (links to W3940), privacy leakage (links to W3939), and integration/operational readiness
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Model Risk / Data Science
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3946_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3946_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3946_Task5" name="AI Governance/business-owners run shadow/pilot deployment and A/B vs current…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/business-owners run shadow/pilot deployment and A/B vs current (champion/challenger) to confirm real-world performance before full rollout (links to VS-30.2)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Data Science / Business Owners
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3946_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3946_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3946_Task6" name="AI Governance/Model-Risk document the assurance pack, approve (with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AI Governance/Model-Risk document the assurance pack, approve (with conditions/conditions-precedent) or reject, and register the approved version (links to W3931); require revalidation on material change (links to W3948)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Model Risk
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3946_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3946_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3946_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3946_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3946_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-616 (ensure controlled execution — AI Lifecycle Operations, Assurance &amp; Value Realization (PA-128.3).) | - operational: mandatory gate; operational: shadow/A-B pilot
Owner: AI Governance / Model Risk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
