    <bpmn:process id="W_W3948" name="W3948. AI Change, Re-training &amp; Model Retirement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Drift alert (links to W3947); business/data change; retirement
Frequency: Per change + periodic
Volume: Model changes/retrains/retirements across portfolio
Owner: AI Governance / Data Science
Participants: AI Governance, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Model Risk (links to VS-21), business AI owners, IT (links to VS-27), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3948 — AI Change, Re-training &amp; Model Retirement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3948_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3948_Lane1" name="AI Governance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3948_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3948_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3948_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3948_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3948_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3948_Start3" name="Drift alert (links to W3947); business/data change; retirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3948_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3948_Task4" name="AI Governance/Data-Science manage model change/retraining: trigger criteria…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Data-Science manage model change/retraining: trigger criteria (drift links to W3947, business change, data-source change), versioning, re-validation (links to W3932/W3946), and controlled rollout (champion/challenger) under change governance (links to VS-27.1/W1409)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Data Science / Model Risk
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3948_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3948_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3948_Task5" name="AI Governance/business-owners manage model retirement when no longer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/business-owners manage model retirement when no longer fit/needed: decommission, revert to rules/human (links to W3941), update the registry (links to W3931), and handle dependent-system impacts
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Business Owners / IT
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per retirement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3948_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3948_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3948_Task6" name="AI Governance/Model-Risk document the change/retirement decision and rationale…">
