        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-616 (ensure controlled execution — AI Lifecycle Operations, Assurance &amp; Value Realization (PA-128.3).) | - operational: mandatory review gate; operational: review gate; operational: transparency and engagement
Owner: AI Governance / CIO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
