Volume: ~30–45 evaluations/year at steady state (~8–12/quarter); each runs offline evals → shadow → canary
Owner: Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer (AAP)
Participants: Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer (AAP), owning product team QA analyst, Agent-Ops SRE (AAP), AI-Governance Liaison, owning team Business Process Owner, SIB (tier ratification), AI Ethics Review Board (conditional items — links to W3952)
Source: workflow W5513 — Agent Shadow &amp; Canary Evaluation, Graduation &amp; Autonomy-Tier Ratification</bpmn:documentation>
