      <bpmn:userTask id="W5513_Task7" name="Shadow mode: the agent runs beside humans with no action rights; output quality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Shadow mode: the agent runs beside humans with no action rights; output quality and human-takeover triggers are measured against the live human baseline
Responsible (R): Evaluation-AI-QA / Owning team
Accountable (A): Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer
Duration: ~2–4 hours review/agent (2–4 weeks elapsed)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5513_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5513_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5513_Task8" name="Canary: bounded live actions inside hard guardrails (limits, whitelists, value…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Canary: bounded live actions inside hard guardrails (limits, whitelists, value caps) with sampled human audit — 100% of actions at first, easing to the tier-scaled floor (≥10%) as evidence accumulates
Responsible (R): Agent-Ops SRE / Owning QA analyst
Accountable (A): Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer
Duration: ~3–5 hours/agent (2–4 weeks elapsed)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5513_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5513_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5513_Task9" name="Graduation gate: Evaluation/AI-QA engineer and the owning team&#x27;s QA analyst…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Graduation gate: Evaluation/AI-QA engineer and the owning team&#x27;s QA analyst co-sign the evaluation pack; failures recycle to the owning team with the failure taxonomy
Responsible (R): Evaluation-AI-QA / Owning QA analyst
Accountable (A): Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer
Duration: 1–2 hours/agent</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5513_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5513_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5513_Task10" name="Autonomy-tier ratification: tier assigned per the ladder (Tier 1…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Autonomy-tier ratification: tier assigned per the ladder (Tier 1 human-approval-gated / Tier 2 bounded / Tier 3 autonomous-in-bounds) and the hard boundaries verified — no statutory filing path (BIR/SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG), no POS/OT estate actions, no SoD-conflicting duty combinations; SIB ratifies
Responsible (R): SIB / AI-Governance Liaison
Accountable (A): Head of EA
Duration: 0.5–1 hour/agent at monthly SIB</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5513_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5513_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5513_Task11" name="Production rollout on the AAP runtime (W5514) with the ratified tier, guardrail…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Production rollout on the AAP runtime (W5514) with the ratified tier, guardrail set, and kill-switch registered; evaluation pack archived for audit (links to W3949)
Responsible (R): Agent-Ops SRE
Accountable (A): Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer
Duration: 1 hour/agent</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5513_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5513_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5513_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5513_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
