        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-616 (ensure controlled execution — AI Lifecycle Operations, Assurance &amp; Value Realization (PA-128.3).) | - operational: graduation gate — dual sign-off (AAP eval engineer + owning QA analyst) | - operational: tier-scaled sampled audit during canary | - operational: hard-boundary verification (statutory filings, POS/OT, SoD) at ratification
Owner: Evaluation/AI-QA Engineer (AAP)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
