    <bpmn:process id="W_W5514" name="W5514. Agent Runtime Operations, Guardrail &amp; Kill-Switch Telemetry, Quarterly Re-Registration &amp; Portfolio Sunset" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Agent in production (continuous telemetry) + quarterly re-registration cycle + agent incident
Frequency: Continuous + quarterly re-registration cycle + per incident
Volume: ~40–70 agents in production at steady state; 100% of agent actions audit-trailed as control evidence against the 808-control register
Owner: Agent-Ops SRE (AAP)
Participants: Agent-Ops SRE (AAP), Agent Engineers (owning squads), AI-Governance Liaison, owning team Business Process Owner, AI Incident Management (links to W3943), Internal Audit (links to W3949), FinOps/TBM (links to VS-135), AI Ethics Review Board (adverse outcomes — links to W3952)
Source: workflow W5514 — Agent Runtime Operations, Guardrail &amp; Kill-Switch Telemetry, Quarterly Re-Registration &amp; Portfolio Sunset</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5514_LaneSet4">
