      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5514_Start5" name="Agent in production (continuous telemetry) + quarterly re-registration cycle + agent…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5514_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5514_Task6" name="Runtime operations on the AAP paved road: agents act only through IAP-published…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Runtime operations on the AAP paved road: agents act only through IAP-published tool contracts (never a database directly) under non-human identities with their own least-privilege ERP roles (links to VS-27/W1408)
Responsible (R): Agent-Ops SRE
Accountable (A): AAP Platform Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5514_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5514_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5514_Task7" name="Telemetry review: drift, error/human-takeover rates, and cost-per-task vs the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Telemetry review: drift, error/human-takeover rates, and cost-per-task vs the human baseline (feeds the AAP KPI row and VS-135 TBM); anomaly → auto-escalation; suspected adverse outcome → the AI incident process (W3943)
Responsible (R): Agent-Ops SRE / Owning team
Accountable (A): AAP Platform Lead
Duration: ~30–45 min/working day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5514_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5514_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5514_Task8" name="Guardrail &amp; kill-switch assurance: rule-based fallback verified per agent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Guardrail &amp; kill-switch assurance: rule-based fallback verified per agent; kill-switch drilled quarterly; guardrail configuration (limits, whitelists, value caps) change-controlled under the IT change process (links to W1409)
Responsible (R): Agent-Ops SRE
Accountable (A): AAP Platform Lead
Duration: Drills ~2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5514_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5514_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5514_Task9" name="Quarterly re-registration: every agent re-affirmed in the VS-128 registry —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly re-registration: every agent re-affirmed in the VS-128 registry — tier still correct, boundaries still valid, DPIA/ethics conditions still fresh (links to W3939/W3952); lapsed agents suspended pending re-ratification (W5513)
Responsible (R): AI-Governance Liaison / Evaluation-AI-QA
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: ~20–30 min/agent × 40–70 agents/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5514_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5514_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5514_Task10" name="QBR portfolio sunset: underperforming agents (low task success, negative…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: QBR portfolio sunset: underperforming agents (low task success, negative cost-per-task, owner withdrawal) retired like any product — identity decommissioned, audit trail archived, tool contracts released (the W3948 retirement pattern); portfolio metrics to the QBR (links to W3951)
Responsible (R): AAP Platform Lead / Owning team / FinOps
Accountable (A): CIO (QBR)
Duration: ~6–8 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5514_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5514_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5514_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5514_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
