        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-616 (ensure controlled execution — AI Lifecycle Operations, Assurance &amp; Value Realization (PA-128.3).) | - operational: IAP-contract-only tool access under non-human least-privilege identity | - operational: kill-switch with rule-based fallback, drilled quarterly | - operational: quarterly re-registration gate; full action audit trail retained as control evidence
Owner: Agent-Ops SRE (AAP)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
